# sshd_config — decoy SSH on port 22.
# The `decoy` user has a LOCKED password ("!"): every password attempt fails,
# and no valid password exists at all. Host keys are generated on first boot.

Port 22
AddressFamily any
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0

PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication yes
PermitEmptyPasswords no
PubkeyAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
ChallengeResponseAuthentication no
UseDNS no

AllowUsers decoy
MaxAuthTries 6
MaxSessions 2
LoginGraceTime 60

PrintMotd no
PrintLastLog no
LogLevel VERBOSE
StrictModes yes

Subsystem sftp internal-sftp
